1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,600
WANGDOO: Captain! I don't like this part!

2
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,400
WANGDOO: Well... we landed.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:08,850
WANGDOO: Technically.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,900
NARRATOR: No fuel. Almost no oxygen. You're stranded.

5
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,900
WANGDOO: Aww! It likes me!

6
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,900
WANGDOO: Okay. It does NOT like me.

7
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:27,300
WANGDOO: Captain... I think I woke something up.

8
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,250
WANGDOO: Too fast! Too fast!

9
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,900
WANGDOO: One power core. Two options.

10
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,300
WANGDOO: And no time!

11
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:49,400
NARRATOR: Which one would you choose?

12
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:58,750
NARRATOR: Think you could solve this? Try real engineering challenges on AltWing.
